  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Starting with the year $2122_{10}$ converted to hex, in how many years (in base10) will the year first be represented by a hexadecimal number where all the digits are the same?",
        "zh": "从转化为十六进制的 $2122_{10}$ 年开始,多少年(十进制)后,十六进制后的年份将由相同的数字组成?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "22",
            "zh": "22"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "62",
            "zh": "62"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "260",
            "zh": "260"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "406",
            "zh": "406"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "608",
            "zh": "608"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "$$\n2122_{10}=8*16^{2}+4*16^{1}+10*16^{0}\n$$\n\n$$\n=84A_{16}\n$$\n\nThe next year with all the same hex digits is $888_{16}$\n\n$$\n888_{16}=8*16^{2}+8*16^{1}+8*16^{0}=2184\n$$\n\nSo 2184 - 2122 = 62\n\nA three-digit repeated hexadecimal number has value $d(16^2+16+1)=273d$. Since $777_{16}=1911<2122<2184=888_{16}$, 888 is the first future one; take the difference in decimal years, not hexadecimal digits. **Answer: B, 62 years.**",
        "zh": "将年份转换为十六进制：$2122_{10}=84A_{16}$。下一个所有数位相同的十六进制数是 $888_{16}=2184_{10}$，所以还需 $2184-2122=62$ 年。\n\n三位数位相同的十六进制数的值为 $d(16^2+16+1)=273d$。因为 $777_{16}=1911<2122<2184=888_{16}$，所以 888 是未来最早的一年；最后要用十进制年份相减。**答案：B，62 年。**"
      },
      "source": {
