    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "The Fibonacci sequence {0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, ...} is formed by adding the two previous terms: 5 + 8 = 13. Which number in the sequence when converted to hexadecimal would have the 2nd occurrence of the substring “0”?",
        "zh": "斐波那契数列{0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, ...}由前两项相加而成,例如:5 +8 = 13。将数列中的每个数字转换为十六进制后,第二次出现子串“0”的是哪个数?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "34",
            "zh": "34"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "55",
            "zh": "55"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "89",
            "zh": "89"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "144",
            "zh": "144"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "233",
            "zh": "233"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "The sequence in hexadecimal begins `0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, D, 15, 22, 37, 59, 90`. The first occurrence of digit 0 is the initial term 0. The second occurs in $90_{16}=144_{10}$.\n\nThe relevant decimal terms are 34, 55, 89, 144, with hexadecimal forms 22, 37, 59, 90. Their remainders on division by 16 are 2, 7, 9, 0 respectively. Do not omit the initial 0 from the occurrence count. **Answer: D, the decimal term 144.**",
        "zh": "数列的十六进制表示依次为 `0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, D, 15, 22, 37, 59, 90`。第一次出现数字 0 的是首项 0，第二次出现于 $90_{16}=144_{10}$。\n\n相关的十进制项 34、55、89、144 分别转为十六进制 22、37、59、90；它们除以 16 的余数分别为 2、7、9、0。计数时不要漏掉数列首项 0。**答案：D，十进制项 144。**"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          3
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
