    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Recursive Functions",
        "zh": "递归函数"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Find $f(10)$, given\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} 1 & \\text{if }x=1\\\\ f(x-1)+3x-2 & \\text{if }x>1 \\end{cases}\n$$",
        "zh": "根据以下条件,求 $f(10)$。\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} 1 & \\text{当 }x=1\\\\ f(x-1)+3x-2 & \\text{当 }x>1 \\end{cases}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "70",
            "zh": "70"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "92",
            "zh": "92"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "117",
            "zh": "117"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "145",
            "zh": "145"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "176",
            "zh": "176"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Each step adds $3x-2$. Thus\n\n$$\nf(10)=1+\\sum_{x=2}^{10}(3x-2)=1+3(54)-2(9)=145\n$$\n\nThe first values are 1, 5, 12, 22. The source solution has a typo in the first expression for f(2): the subtracted constant must be 2.\n\nThere are nine increments, for x=2 through 10, and $2+3+\\cdots+10=54$. The initial value $f(1)=1$ is included once, rather than applying the recursive formula at x=1. **Answer: D.**",
        "zh": "每一步增加 $3x-2$，因此\n\n$$\nf(10)=1+\\sum_{x=2}^{10}(3x-2)=1+3(54)-2(9)=145\n$$\n\n前几项为 1、5、12、22。原卷解析中 f(2) 的第一处表达式有笔误，减去的常数应为 2。\n\n从 x=2 到 x=10 共有九次增量，且 $2+3+\\cdots+10=54$。初值 $f(1)=1$ 只计一次，不应再在 x=1 套用递推分支。**答案：D。**"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
