    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Recursive Number Systems",
        "zh": "递归数制"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate $f(100,36)-f(36,100)$ , given\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\begin{cases} f\\!\\left(\\left[\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right],\\left[\\dfrac{y}{2}\\right]\\right)+2 & \\text{if }xy\\ge50\\\\ f(2x,y-3)+1 & \\text{if }10<xy<50\\\\ xy-x-y & \\text{if }xy\\le10 \\end{cases}\n$$\n\nwhere [z] returns the greatest integer less than or equal to z",
        "zh": "根据以下条件,计算 $f(100,36)-f(36,100)$ 。\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=\\begin{cases} f\\!\\left(\\left[\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right],\\left[\\dfrac{y}{2}\\right]\\right)+2 & \\text{当 }xy\\ge50\\\\ f(2x,y-3)+1 & \\text{当 }10<xy<50\\\\ xy-x-y & \\text{当 }xy\\le10 \\end{cases}\n$$\n\n其中[z]返回小于或等于z的最大整数。"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "128",
            "zh": "128"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "-134",
            "zh": "-134"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "-1",
            "zh": "-1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "-125",
            "zh": "-125"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "-143",
            "zh": "-143"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Evaluate each chain from its base case upward, applying the floor operation before the recursive call:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(48,-2)&=-142\\\\ f(24,1)&=-142+1=-141\\\\ f(12,4)&=-141+1=-140\\\\ f(25,9)&=-140+2=-138\\\\ f(50,18)&=-138+2=-136\\\\ f(100,36)&=-136+2=-134\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(8,1)&=-1\\\\ f(4,4)&=-1+1=0\\\\ f(8,9)&=0+2=2\\\\ f(4,12)&=2+1=3\\\\ f(9,25)&=3+2=5\\\\ f(18,50)&=5+2=7\\\\ f(36,100)&=7+2=9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore $f(100,36)-f(36,100)=-134-9=-143$.\n\nFor example, $(25,9)$ has product 225, so halving and flooring gives $(12,4)$ with a pending +2. But $(12,4)$ has product 48, so it becomes $(24,1)$ with +1. On the other chain, $(8,9)$ has product 72 and must use +2. The base values are $48(-2)-48-(-2)=-142$ and $8-8-1=-1$. Swapping x and y need not preserve f because the middle branch treats them differently. **Answer: E.**",
        "zh": "先求出各递归链的终止值，再逐层返回；进入递归调用前按要求向下取整：\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(48,-2)&=-142\\\\ f(24,1)&=-142+1=-141\\\\ f(12,4)&=-141+1=-140\\\\ f(25,9)&=-140+2=-138\\\\ f(50,18)&=-138+2=-136\\\\ f(100,36)&=-136+2=-134\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(8,1)&=-1\\\\ f(4,4)&=-1+1=0\\\\ f(8,9)&=0+2=2\\\\ f(4,12)&=2+1=3\\\\ f(9,25)&=3+2=5\\\\ f(18,50)&=5+2=7\\\\ f(36,100)&=7+2=9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n所以 $f(100,36)-f(36,100)=-134-9=-143$。\n\n例如 $(25,9)$ 的乘积为 225，因此向下取整后变为 $(12,4)$，并保留一次 +2；但 $(12,4)$ 的乘积为 48，下一步应变为 $(24,1)$ 并加 1。另一条链的 $(8,9)$ 乘积为 72，必须使用 +2。两个终止值分别是 $48(-2)-48-(-2)=-142$ 与 $8-8-1=-1$。中间分支对 x、y 的处理不同，交换参数不能假定函数值不变。**答案：E。**"
      },
      "source": {
