    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "What Does This Program Do?",
        "zh": "程序分析"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "What is the final value of x after this program is executed?\n\n```text\na = 1: b = 2: c = 3: x = 0\nif a < b then\n    x = x + a\nelse\n    x = x + b\nend if\nif b > c && a <= b then\n    x = x + c\nelse\n    x = x + a\nend if\nif !(a < b && a < c) then\n    x = x + a\nend if\nif b < c || c < a then\n    x = x + c\nend if\noutput x\n```",
        "zh": "该程序执行后,x的最终值是什么?\n\n```text\na = 1: b = 2: c = 3: x = 0\nif a < b then\n    x = x + a\nelse\n    x = x + b\nend if\nif b > c && a <= b then\n    x = x + c\nelse\n    x = x + a\nend if\nif !(a < b && a < c) then\n    x = x + a\nend if\nif b < c || c < a then\n    x = x + c\nend if\noutput x\n```"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "5",
            "zh": "5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "6",
            "zh": "6"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "7",
            "zh": "7"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Trace the variables in execution order:\n\n| a | b | c | x |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 0 |\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 1 |\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 2 |\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 2 |\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 5 |\n\nThe successive updates to x are +1, +1, no change and +3. The final value is 5.\n\nThe four conditions evaluate to true; false AND true (false); NOT(true AND true) (false); and true OR false (true). Thus the second IF takes its else branch, while the third IF makes no update. Each IF is separate, so later tests still run. **Answer: B, 5.**",
        "zh": "按程序执行顺序记录变量的值：\n\n| a | b | c | x |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 0 |\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 1 |\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 2 |\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 2 |\n| 1 | 2 | 3 | 5 |\n\nx 依次增加 1、增加 1、保持不变、增加 3，最终为 5。\n\n四个条件依次为：真；假 AND 真（假）；NOT(真 AND 真)（假）；真 OR 假（真）。因此第二个 IF 执行 else 分支，第三个 IF 不修改 x。四个 IF 相互独立，不会因前面有一个成立就跳过后续判断。**答案：B，5。**"
      },
